menu "PokeWalk"

config POKEWALK_SILENT_BOOT
    bool "Keep audio disabled for the entire boot"
    default n
    help
        Shut down the ES8311 at the first app initialization and keep all BSP
        audio output, format changes and volume calls disabled. No SFX queue
        or playback task is created, including for demo/debug callers.
        Disable and rebuild to restore audio. This is not a runtime volume
        setting. Boards without a PA GPIO use the codec shutdown path.

endmenu
